    "title": "Parliamentary delegation from Kazakhstan visits AKU",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "A high level parliamentary delegation of the Republic of Kazakhstan visited Aga Khan University (AKU) on August 23 - 25, 2001, as part of its three-day visit to Pakistan at the invitation of Aga Khan Development Network (AKDN).",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "7a9ae6c6657156b7",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "1017-BannerImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/1017-BannerImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "Parliamentary delegation from Kazakhstan visits AKU"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A high level parliamentary delegation of the Republic of Kazakhstan visited Aga Khan University (AKU) on August 23 - 25, 2001, as part of its three-day visit to Pakistan at the invitation of Aga Khan Development Network (AKDN)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "During their stay, the eight-member delegation headed by Mr. Sharip Omarov, Chairman of the Committee on International Affairs, Defence and Security, visited AKDN to get acquainted with the Network and its related programmes. This also included a tour of AKU where the delegation met with Dr. Shamsh Kassim-Lakha, President, AKU, and other senior management of the University, for discussion on various topics including the establishment of the University of Central Asia (UCA). "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The delegation also visited AKU Institute for Educational Development and the Aga Khan Education Service, Pakistan."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
